As the hypothetical ruler of the world, I would prioritize the following initiatives: 

1. Establishing global peace and conflict resolution mechanisms in order to prevent war and other forms of violence; 
2. Ensuring equal distribution of resources and access to education for all people regardless of their background or situation;
3. Investing in cutting-edge science and technology while supporting sustainability, in order to mitigate climate change and preserve our planet; 
4. Reducing inequality and poverty through economic programs that help lift people out of poverty; 
5. Improving healthcare services and promoting mental health awareness around the world; 
6. Supporting local governments and non-profit organizations to increase community-level initiatives aimed at building better societies; 
7. Encouraging cultural exchange and respect between different societies and promoting understanding across diverse communities. 

These are just some suggestions, as being the ruler of the world would come with many more responsibilities. It is important to note that these ideas would only be possible if there was complete cooperation from the governments and people of all nations across the globe.
